+# ION Agent Context Branches
+
+Status: active provisional runtime lane
+Created: 2026-05-11
+
+This folder holds unique branch capsules for active conversations, agents, tasks, and workpackets.
+
+Shared Codex solo context remains settled base context and must not be used as a multi-agent scratchpad.
+
+Branch capsules may inherit from shared context, but they cannot overwrite it. They submit candidate settlement packets through:
+
+```text
+ION/05_context/current/context_settlement/inbox/
+```
+
+Current protocol:
+
+```text
+ION/02_architecture/ION_AGENT_BRANCH_CAPSULE_PROTOCOL_V0_1.md
+```
+
+Core law:
+
+```text
+one agent/conversation/task = one named branch capsule
+shared context write = false
+settlement required = true
+```

